c018de9ce700d90aae3b564afc351b4d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"yew longbow","source_tag":"entity name","target":"紫杉长弓"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f16e363746f748465bdabe1bfb6626900f236af408bd4903b1c674806811aa42","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4106941b1ead249300a4ddb3d1255f1e8e5c809e626281efe3297455a4b29f82","logical_entry_identity":"f4d02754cbc72f8ee1a0a3a9ca6f6ebb95948f0df6922b5e8d93fdd476490c17","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Test dummy.","source_tag":"_t","target":"训练傀儡。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fd2d3a34689bd77c81fb6fb0d47c0dae99b1e97fb7cfe8a084371fde56e0340","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41083c3b975ea67b268e60f5bb1e85c1d117da2fbf0d8011f45d5a4ba2515768","logical_entry_identity":"f1c227c371f91c46e23cb4def4a93d7efd7dbe441c6777585bdafe5d71f8bfd6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"rattlesnake","source_tag":"entity name","target":"响尾蛇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"de0746baeb659a7e696b44a403ec37ce065fd1d738aa6913bd76255b702d9009","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41088adc7528850c0c9ca5ed46763d820ba4c40f756eae15501fba1ca42a77f2","logical_entry_identity":"a883255970114b472b922da47fc3980c236b7b656ce4319170bdf6befefd6776","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#On touching the blood-dripping knife, memories flood your mind - this time, with incredible intensity.  You drop the knife immediately, thankful you only touched the plain handle, and not the rune-lit blade or the red pool under it.  Moments later, your mind starts parsing and interpreting what it just absorbed:#{normal}#\n\npain.  pain loneliness and cold, so much cold and it keeps growing.  in my dreams i can't move a muscle thanks to this #{italic}##FIREBRICK#[untranslatably foul profanity]#LAST##{normal}# cage.  he never had his chance.  could've made the world in his image.  could've made a peaceful world, one of meadows and soft rolling hills, if the other gods hadn't fought with him over it.  might've made humans - in any case he watched over us, protected us from those #{italic}##FIREBRICK#[untranslatably ancient profanity]#LAST##{normal}# squid until they drove him into the void\n\nhe suffers on a distant world, his power leeched out bit by bit for reasons never told to him by evildoers he's never seen.  this is not right.  he must be free.  i must be free.  he must come to eyal so our vision for it can finally be realized\n\nit will be\n\n#{italic}#so#{normal}#\n\n\n\n#{italic}##FIREBRICK#b e a u t i f u l#LAST##{normal}#\n\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#触碰这把滴血的刀时，记忆汹涌灌入你的脑海——这一次，强烈得难以置信。你立刻扔下刀，庆幸自己只碰了朴素的刀柄，没碰泛着符文光芒的刀刃，也没碰刀下的血泊。片刻之后，你的思维开始解析、理解刚刚吸收的内容：#{normal}#\n\n痛。痛，孤独，还有寒冷，好冷，寒意还在不断加剧。梦里，我被这座#{italic}##FIREBRICK#[无法翻译的恶毒咒骂]#LAST##{normal}#牢笼困得一根手指也动不了。他从未得到机会。本可以照自己的意愿塑造世界。本可以创造一个安宁的世界，遍布草甸和起伏平缓的山丘，只怪其他诸神为了这个世界与他交战。也许人类正是他创造的——不管怎样，他一直守护着我们，保护我们免受那些#{italic}##FIREBRICK#[无法翻译的古老咒骂]#LAST##{normal}#乌贼的侵害，直到它们把他逼入虚空。\n\n他在遥远的世界受苦，从未谋面的恶徒不曾告诉他缘由，便一点点抽走他的力量。不该这样。他必须获得自由。我必须获得自由。他必须来到埃亚尔，唯有如此，我们对埃亚尔的愿景才能最终实现。\n\n那一切会\n\n#{italic}#如 此#{normal}#\n\n\n\n#{italic}##FIREBRICK#美 好#LAST##{normal}#\n\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"372a5ddeb5ff20f5a9e3a9cebf483546f3fd7cd28e338cd300543968dadebb42","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4108f3d1494a573ad4b49696c66c1e279b7d43143d1184fb04c1754cec9ffa8f","logical_entry_identity":"f690c9085ec84d182edabd0f31b9083d88c37f4f64c097f40f23db4847694e99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An Archmage devotes his whole life to the study of magic above anything else.","source_tag":"_t","target":"对一个元素法师来说魔法超越一切，他们倾尽一生学习魔法。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a4930718df07758a37e3cefdf5f7393760b32f313e96ae3d64f0a078f211473d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"410ed64193bf703ae41fad995486744d3b7beb25cd6dc9a9d6e981a75073f03f","logical_entry_identity":"e1a47b88c8d1100824f2c8196f8383058d42ab6198873636862343cec4af8029","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"banshee","source_tag":"entity name","target":"哀嚎女妖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e4463e7319d0ab5c4447148bfc299852acaa6f5ade065f64a3284787a470990","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"411241122fab737c861077b7722b7929ffb0e87159a7cc784b5b97da1513c8a0","logical_entry_identity":"63d75b2f17a21f5885537d651b6010dca89a236f55a3cd1514a07979fd0e2883","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Whatever their plan may be, they must be stopped at all cost.","source_tag":"_t","target":"不管他们的目的是要干什么，必须不惜一切代价阻止他们。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"959561b1305711bcd8b717108adf1c2c085f8e916a01c54f81599cba7b0b1a21","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"411283c0889a1db3b57adc6e0ffa9442e340e478bd827fe50d01848089162d53","logical_entry_identity":"5e243d63bd7ee13c979f510d06cd2f306cdeb18e0af2341b671df6d8fb436226","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ghoul","source_tag":"birth descriptor name","target":"食尸鬼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca95ac7a0de3b510e262ced030e6193d000f9f124b59b1721c4246284cc63da8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41159144ba17c39e34893329c695ee7b673d6f42a9b252893d380e2d08723ddb","logical_entry_identity":"49b6a39cdc2323c6451dfe7b18907ef8561c76a9631d1c113da629b67852f80e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Redhead Melinda","source_tag":"_t","target":"红发梅琳达"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"924bff603d0e6ea1db61d14ab7a063817524e7d50a2030f3eea6aef6bb452bf7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"411b610a84309df9efead4401e5edd76a64429792a3c8c51665d6564a4607733","logical_entry_identity":"43766fe04b08c6ec326d8c284247a97d2e65034e6906b0c4ca0ab69d6602f1e2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"coral invasion portal","source_tag":"_t","target":"珊瑚入侵传送门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cfda1f0e5bc5e7fae04fead2a755340868605fc24d7421cc809559862911926","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"411cc4114463f08fba4734759393cd6425005055bb43e5d7dc0f4091e55d65c8","logical_entry_identity":"0414798ac88c93b604710904ef04f758f728536ceb47e67e9a4a1d08f63195df","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ANTIQUE_WHITE#has linked a creature: #WHITE# %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#ANTIQUE_WHITE#链接了一个生物：#WHITE# %s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f253fd6c061c3f764641e6fb17cc0db837faa87da96eea7c0cc6c2a691badc9d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4121385b9de7c8c2b41999aa7881e8bc8af9c54f77df0cb476cefd780486708c","logical_entry_identity":"19aa06106c1323c62fd31622cc7c748b3dcab707aa874a5029d1f0e5479b4c67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Wave(TOP) %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"波次(TOP) %d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d181afc795fa77a50104bc924e5886031647c046f8b11441ae6e5d2550900e69","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41232b80e1b68cc6f39d3cfcc591b3a952e4fa8302cad30e00d022a9a9c58a1f","logical_entry_identity":"d4fcd7a905e90d6cf3b812dcc82ddc198b0329b970f8c2509e34698bce14abfb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Killed 1000 humanoids.","source_tag":"_t","target":"杀死1000个人形怪物。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"65d7cc407a31133b98c2e3fd91b7046bc142bb93da7f1a851b517012680daa83","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4129756f0da163b9d22541a21e5a1c46cbbe9cdc4175e65dbcdfe02de5faa177","logical_entry_identity":"f5c34b2d6db98881f3255733b968b96ad97e6f8c3519ad9d5be73b11ee5687ce","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fires a beam that turns matter into dust, inflicting %0.2f temporal damage and %0.2f physical (warp) damage.\n\t\tAlternatively you may target yourself, creating a field of radius %d around you that will inflict the damage over three turns.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射一道射线，令物质归于尘土，造成 %0.2f 时空与 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t也可以以自己为目标，制造一个围绕自己 %d 码的领域，在 3 回合内造成伤害。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc3b7c5732e30ba5515ebd4f73a5ee63f4dab9cd81d3772f4bde19535be1cd8d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"412d6d7b5e2125e96e6247ac03258d557cbec3129ff76aea3d7f53ea81c9eda0","logical_entry_identity":"d01969dd062a4d4bcabf044fd54f0c81f7cb5810398f9291a6b8c5268bccddb5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is protected a raging storm deflecting up to %d instances of damage over %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标受到狂暴风暴的保护，可以偏转至多 %d 次伤害，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64aea90765f545ca4df909069466e2e9a82c5d7a47d2d4f0eed55b5d1075cf60","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"412db7f430ea83b86298f807422d795f3c04ad916e3e9215e64ddc8d86a6c118","logical_entry_identity":"55ff314e3b548c5e1bfe7731596e9b89f7938185afe507b498d2af4be11b65cd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You gave the Orb of Many Ways to Tannen to study while you look for the athame and diamond in Reknor.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你把多元水晶球交给泰恩研究，自己则去瑞库纳寻找仪式匕首和共鸣钻石。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e9830cbf7d3ff9189e83a0c4713ef590c47893c947c2f939ebbca955b6f8430","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4131a3f97f9e1b299d0fb64ad00815190c584fd12150a81b50c60d272d756e49","logical_entry_identity":"68f99799040d230824e319f2db343940900ba58843b5b5afa8d18ed7b9e6dedd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Allows you to dig a wall, remove a tree, create ways.","source_tag":"_t","target":"允许你挖墙、移除一棵树并制造道路。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d40c3b2cf984d3f91125df010e9a6fe59b22629fed1ad5a120db578648625641","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"413aa83989cfea2c429593287b8caeab52c0051af31f0760e9e152a6136ad719","logical_entry_identity":"a9970cfb796e40a61c9aaba1bed5c5ee7d3ba9db0d670d53b8c620a40597c2c7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target#'s is no longer disrupted.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#的魔法力量不再被干扰。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fa8a5222e451190a661060b57c3119afea9820950dcd97b04e5c1e5d8cc9de9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"413d300827341a71716fb6a9642ee51830cd14b2df5914f61207182469f6086c","logical_entry_identity":"f7804f313d635a5fcc92d2cf3aed03578b25c7a7d93a086aadbcba73634c739a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Coral Portal","source_tag":"_t","target":"珊瑚传送门"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ec27813053ead8a661a928525b9caba32ab8b4f2bc3c33223bd62315b75aa57","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"413ec086c2cba0062199956595580e2c04410b4d262097ce28fa5421da78c703","logical_entry_identity":"b1f1571bf649a55e7f7730ace66592efd7094e91580ffa34d77b179b654afa31","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Deep Wounds","source_tag":"_t","target":"-重伤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4e6b0d1af2f6cbf440224b9f27c78fec1bcfbcc2bbd001a29ac282b8644cc989","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"414061076a126611c8e0f5c8c15d9a9ed15cbfde69c0f1eda704845c5656c573","logical_entry_identity":"bd7257c9a1b9b6d27187a6dd91cd47d61628eafdb611d8b90551d3ec644652c1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Scintillating Caverns must be protected. Our great leader has ordered it so, and his word is more binding than any law. Our numbers are few, and we must move in secrecy, but a quiet watch will be made on the caverns. Any who are seen to interfere in them must be lured here to our place of strength, and brought before me for inquisition.\n\nMore have joined our cause. Their eyes have been opened to the injustice our people have suffered, blamed by the other races for the Spellblaze and its effects. They are sick of the cowardice of the Council, who sit in silence as we are scorned and hated across the world. But most of all they are inspired by our great leader, and the powers he has gained from studying the Spellblaze. He alone realizes our full potential, he alone can see in our hearts what we are truly capable of. He has blessed me, rescued me from a tortured life and touched me with his power. Only he can lead our people! With his mastery the world will see our strength and recognise us as a true force to be reckoned with.\n\nTrust in his power, for he shall bring us all to glory.\n\n-- The Inquisitor","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪光洞穴必须受到保护。伟大的领袖已经下令，他的话比任何法律都更不容违逆。我们人数不多，行动必须隐秘，但仍要暗中监视洞穴。凡被发现干涉其中事务的人，都必须诱到我们这处据点，再带到我面前接受审问。\n又有更多人投身我们的事业。他们终于看清了我族遭受的不公：其他种族把魔法大爆炸及其影响都归罪于我们。他们受够了长老会的怯懦——当我们在世界各地遭到蔑视与憎恨时，那群人只会默不作声。但最令他们振奋的，还是我们伟大的领袖，以及他研究魔法大爆炸所得的力量。唯有他洞悉我族全部潜能，唯有他能看透我们内心真正拥有的力量。他赐福于我，将我从备受折磨的人生中拯救出来，又以自己的力量触碰了我。唯有他能领导我们的人民！在他的掌控下，世界将见证我们的力量，承认我们是一股不可轻视的势力。信赖他的力量吧，他必将带领我们所有人走向荣耀。\n\n-- 审判者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1be8abdccf8b87e83d56495c47fb842636922cb87053f2d5fc8a212b0ccc1893","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41410e3d80d1d55de69e950a48cbe81971f5702033d0a668664aeedf7e8fd5c0","logical_entry_identity":"667937d7bc2a5a8d59f3f5b62b1f987509bdfabc041f90bcfcb1aa655129f27f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When one of your spells goes critical, you bind glyphs in radius 1 centered on a random target in range %d at the cost of 5 positive and 5 negative energy.\n\t\tGlyphs last for %d turns and cause various effects when an enemy enters their grid.\n\t\tGlyphs will only spawn on enemies that aren't adjacent to an existing glyph.\n\t\tThis can only happen every %d game turns.\n\t\tGlyph effects will scale with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\tAvailable glyphs are:\n\t\t#ffd700#Glyph of Sunlight#LAST#:  Bind sunlight into a glyph. When triggered it will release a brilliant light, dealing %0.2f light damage and healing you for %d.\n\t\t#7f7f7f#Glyph of Moonlight#LAST#:  Bind moonlight into a glyph. When triggered it will release a fatiguing darkness,  dealing %0.2f darkness damage and reducing the foes damage dealt by %d%% for %d turns.\n\t\t#9D9DC9#Glyph of Twilight#LAST#:  Bind twilight into a glyph. When triggered it will release a burst of twilight, dealing %0.2f light and %0.2f darkness damage and knocking the foe back %d tiles.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你的法术暴击时，你消耗 5 点正能量和负能量，在范围 %d 内的随机目标周围 1 码半径的区域内放置随机圣印。\n\t\t圣印持续 %d 回合，当敌人踩上时，会对其产生特殊效果。\n\t\t圣印只会在周围没有圣印的敌人周围产生。\n\t\t每 %d 游戏回合最多触发一次该效果。\n\t\t圣印效果受法术强度加成。\n\n\t\t有以下几种可用的圣印：\n\t\t#ffd700#日光圣印#LAST#——将阳光注入圣印。当其触发时，将会释放出明亮耀眼的光芒，造成 %0.2f 光系伤害，并恢复你 %d 生命值。\n\t\t#7f7f7f#月光圣印#LAST#——将月光注入圣印。当其触发时，将会释放出疲惫困倦的黑暗，造成 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并使目标所造成的伤害减少 %d%%，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t#9D9DC9#暮光圣印#LAST#——将暮光注入圣印。当其触发时，将会释放出突然爆炸的暮光，造成 %0.2f 光系和 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并将目标击退 %d 格。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fe28d5af9eeacbe8dd1291def4e956338de648db490ad526842d58ea530d9692","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41424d443d77208f3630f60ee6d96ec957c585fbd5af6ee2c05494791a31b787","logical_entry_identity":"4cf5bd99ff1e19413601879ee41905da4aceba5875d0787f40806d2fd0ad07bf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#Seek out Kyless' cave in the northern part of the meadow and end him. Perhaps the curse will end with him.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#找出位于草原北部的克里斯的洞穴，然后杀掉他，他的死也许会解除这个诅咒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6db55ecbdf91e31a5e03103183ac8676d3996e6d51a92d5807801c2d4ac58ddb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4150e706810c9853fe1f51ee9e8a37fa4983f896871e44464f7926405e9d3c83","logical_entry_identity":"336d7d177a9d15942275692eb3cc72e292e853346428f2a9dc3b583979097980","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire Storm","source_tag":"talent name","target":"火焰风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3104df28ff85e7d151e7e4c783448262e5203604d0e1ce00154fa9ac17ae458e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"415478b641160e7e289c6cc706e9b9928e8f594c30dfa0798806feb09d826052","logical_entry_identity":"b3c8899eb2b4c6ae3c778ae4c9dd387bdce78a1467920d8ae9afd0273170f685","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"white crystal","source_tag":"entity name","target":"白色水晶体"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"041b8cf64f20df42df6914f58f18a93c5ed7a875a80280312f05ba2d884d7047","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41580418cdf2dff5be8abb6485d87454e98d685b8058853cc09e718d4f8e29b0","logical_entry_identity":"61d3eb8827d1bf5053a103065f129879cd04e02ad4cf2f31ee8cfed26cdb549d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"tore themself apart","source_tag":"_t","target":"把自己撕成碎片"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f6ffbccdc059ec2c9ab11c7e33a503002bb9c3a056514e3098902361b0f08f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"415a8dcfb787b5766e7d14c1310491fef5cdd31b964a4c06cb00f1320f85a171","logical_entry_identity":"7cf46bb141fc4932e646fb28bc6aedc1162aac6f7042b06cabfdd7d16fea0925","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I can give you a cloak that will conceal your true nature!\nWith it all people will see when they look at you is a normal average Human. You can go about your business.\nPlease!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我可以给你一件斗篷，它能隐藏你的真实本质！\n穿上它，任何人看到的都只会是一个普通人类，你便可以自由行事。\n求求你！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e76c96753b9c40cde674126c872a7b52516afcb780662b503a2d7a95e62dde7f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"416356d9d09fed9b7777b426da12b30be0b1c5f3fa154f046bff7b36f3f01e2f","logical_entry_identity":"786821ceca7e4f517322b966ee5e612ae03437f5f126a4c39dc6eef81191d5c4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have explored the Maze and vanquished the Horned Horror.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已经探索了迷宫并杀死了长角恐魔。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6757bf0448e9195de4f622e7934f4a2471cbb0b300c9605ed9a43b6e761b3130","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4164207c28aee56a47472e39cd39f6e106af450456b8a345cd9211276fae6503","logical_entry_identity":"96ef8a6ad0e71d707759c2cd9746fb1f20c53494c49c94327bfaed932fb5e569","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\nRight click to toggle resources bars visibility","source_tag":"_t","target":"\n右键点击切换资源槽是否可见"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"801270ad7c2acf9589e767c4b0cd7536707b7f4b555dd73836900644d9e250ad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41677a7f27ec207c70ea6929404f147a7edb5911d4c84551da501990aa2ff79f","logical_entry_identity":"502809e398d211ec5583f6a9247048feeb87d175cc7a73384324e04cb0ba0b04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#%s's unbreakable will shrugs off the effect!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#%s 的坚定意志豁免了此效果！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43318e28a23d89b7452d0494b727cdf72ddfcc0ab985ab8cf47c9513887e3c60","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4168234a930915fad785f5f8d2e0783c4ba1b357bc0d00191978b5d2fdb597dd","logical_entry_identity":"f77ff105a9cb7085b94ac1ee6a2285d08ab67f3776d0022252d8a25302d1d8e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s's ghost walk fizzles!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s的游魂行走失败了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd41c1bf87ff804fd9d76b24166d403062935e1ae62bd952023d0bd2aeb43cd9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41690ae21c4a2235b4b99231787876ca749ff529c4c9773f4a801bdcbfa72a6c","logical_entry_identity":"d5c1a885c540659cba1112259efb6c6c9b8f85e28328265d1258f7f7aa6e120f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Aether Breach","source_tag":"_t","target":"+以太裂隙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"812f65f970c8b361c7c50ef830ec1c5e267762ca2178475f88a5b04ba3ee9b1e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"416df4f634d976dbed726f4af322ee16bf5d62c118fe9d1cb24b914dffad40ed","logical_entry_identity":"de5720625d5c64ffa94a1f3dc75668ce0c65b2e1becd47a3f050c512ef5a7842","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dwarven-steel waraxe","source_tag":"entity name","target":"矮人钢斧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f8a30a5f1e4a0c4d0f357e12c6b90855b6e038b878332d526cfc6f6cee68266c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"416df85e8f8a1f06d9d323032db30be4e6c0d215da4b1009298e14c5ff10766f","logical_entry_identity":"c276e58fda6587af1b69c7c5f58e773bb84fc5e9a0fce3cc7fc70164b8e16a8f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Got a character to level 30.","source_tag":"_t","target":"角色达到30级。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1425a1849b64e839ab62929d0b721cb22ea23bf4f0f20c90d4d6ef884c83659b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"41715e91daf62d1ea31d565324032463fc1c2302d5e5a3387b963a174a0b3158","logical_entry_identity":"41a693b9b5cbdc6c6352912f172bb5549cf63f0676bad83236c662de596c5758","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"One last thing. There's a few other fellows angling for the same slot in the Brotherhood that I am. They're not going to be sitting on their hands while we're at work here, so best move quick-like. Now, which of these do you want to help me with first: the Brew of Brawn, the Brew of Stoneskin, or the Brew of Foundations? Or Elixirs, rather. Not Brews. Best get in the habit now, I suppose.","source_tag":"_t","target":"最后一件事，除我之外还有几个家伙对炼金术士兄弟会的这个会员资格虎视眈眈，他们肯定不希望我来坐这个位置的，因此你越快动身越好。现在，你选择帮我完成哪个药剂吧：蛮牛药剂？石肤药剂？还是领悟药剂？哦，应该说药剂（Elixirs）。不是酿造物（Brews）。最好现在就开始改口，我想。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"44f1fbd310aa259d6de38f03a794da045385aadec74ae70b31b9cfb522035446","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"417c834b419e870c4f8996f8cdfba3fd707b161f6484cfa736fd315127379f31","logical_entry_identity":"141731be275f7b922647d038286c097eb86a6001ccc5dcc4c8adce10143029a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Surround yourself with protective arcane forces.\n\t\tEach time you receive a direct heal (not a life regeneration effect), you automatically gain a damage shield equal to %d%% of the heal value for 3 turns.\n\t\tThis will replace an existing damage shield if the new shield value and duration would be greater than or equal to the old.\n\t\tThe shield value will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使你的周身围绕着保护性的奥术能量。\n\t\t每当你获得一个直接治疗时（非持续恢复效果）你会自动获得一个护盾，护盾强度为治疗量的 %d%%，持续 3 回合。\n\t\t如果新护盾的量和持续时间比当前护盾大或相等，将会取代之。\n\t\t护盾强度受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"362d814cd47090eddf49712da75e54d8a9e0f76f68ceb1ff8461a2e073d9c442","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"418377e85cc4e3b29f3f90ba6bb3424cf5b4333787e05447141582cb124b7fa6","logical_entry_identity":"3c93b81db134f33551eb2fa3929528965ac9eb63396b1bda5536b55e8eae0eff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bulwarks are defensive fighters that can take hits more readily than other warriors whilst preparing for the most effective counter attacks.","source_tag":"init.l